  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1287/808/armory_full_1200_700-png.png\" alt=\"軍械庫 Logo\"></p>\n<h2>👑 史詩級護甲套裝，擁有獨特設計與套裝加成。</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模組載入器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"法術引擎\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列作品</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"聖騎士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法師\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盜賊\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能樹\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠寶\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"聖物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"兵工廠\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安裝方式</h1>\n<h3>必要模組</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>弓箭手（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>聖騎士與牧師（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>盜賊與戰士（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>法師（RPG 系列）</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>⭐️ 特色</h1>\n<p>本模組新增高階（終局）護甲套裝，專為 RPG 系列模組中的戰鬥職業設計。</p>\n<h2>📦 取得方式</h2>\n<p>可從終局戰利品箱（終界城市、遠古城市）與首領掉落物中取得「卓越護甲升級」與「升級水晶」。</p>\n<p>使用這些道具將你的 RPG 系列職業護甲升級為史詩變體！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1374/877/armory_token-png.png\" alt=\"升級\"></p>\n<h2>👑 史詩級護甲套裝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>額外屬性套裝加成</li>\n<li>法術修正套裝加成</li>\n<li>獨特的高品質模型，部分帶有發光部位</li>\n<li>支援基礎護甲紋飾（所有紋路皆產生相同圖案）</li>\n<li>美術風格參考《Minecraft Dungeons》美學</li>\n<li>靈感來自著名的經典 MMORPG 套裝 :)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1375/623/armory_updated-png.png\" alt=\"護甲套裝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1262/14/creative_tab-png.png\" alt=\"創造模式選單\"></p>\n<h1>專為多人遊戲設計</h1>\n<p>建立屬於自己的 RPG 伺服器。使用我們的優惠碼可享更低價格，同時也能支持我們。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"取得伺服器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多內容嗎？</h1>\n<p>探索由我們深受喜愛的合作夥伴們所製作的眾多法術引擎模組系列！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"無政府狀態\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"傭兵與工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手擴充（更多 RPG 職業）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂戰士（更多 RPG 職業）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法師（更多 RPG 職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力場大師（更多 RPG 職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"獵魔人（更多 RPG 職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡騎士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
